* 18 Aug 26 Windows port - the $SAVEDLISTS VOC id is now $savedlists
* 18 Aug 26 Windows port - $svlists lower case on disk; the VOC id is unchanged
* 17 Oct 26 dm  S.64 part 2: SAVE.LIST ... IN a VOC, a dictionary or a program file asks edit_guard before it takes the list or writes.
* 13 Sep 26 dm  A saved-list file it has to create is $svlists on disk (plan M3 D3).
* 12 Sep 26 dm  The saved-list VOC id is $savedlists (plan M3, first rename).
